<div class="sedna-col sedna-gap-20" style="max-width:560px">
    <div class="form-field">
        <label class="form-label" for="ai-eta">Expected delivery</label>
        <div class="input-group">
            <input class="form-input" id="ai-eta" type="text" value="Thu 14 Nov, 09:00–11:00" />
            <button class="badge badge-ai badge-ai--icon" type="button" popovertarget="ai-eta-why">
                <i class="ri-sparkling-2-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span class="visually-hidden">AI-generated: why this delivery date</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="popover" id="ai-eta-why" popover>
        <strong class="popover-title">Suggested by the dispatch agent</strong>
        <p>From the carrier's slot for this postcode and the last 30 deliveries on the route.</p>
        <div class="kv"><span class="k">Model</span><span class="v">route-planner 3</span></div>
        <div class="kv"><span class="k">Confidence</span><span class="confidence" data-level="2"><span class="confidence-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Fairly sure</span></span></div>
        <div class="kv"><span class="k">Was</span><span class="v">Wed 13 Nov, 14:00–16:00</span></div>
        <div class="popover-actions">
            <button class="btn btn--sm" type="button" popovertarget="ai-eta-why" popovertargetaction="hide"><i class="ri-arrow-go-back-line"></i> <span>Revert to the original</span></button>
            <button class="btn btn--sm btn--brand btn--solid" type="button" popovertarget="ai-eta-why" popovertargetaction="hide">Keep it</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <table class="table">
            <thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Category</th><th class="col-num">Weight</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>ORD-4209</td>
                    <td>
                        <span>Fragile goods</span>
                        <button class="badge badge-ai badge-ai--icon" type="button" popovertarget="ai-cat-why">
                            <i class="ri-sparkling-2-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            <span class="visually-hidden">AI-generated: why this category</span>
                        </button>
                    </td>
                    <td class="col-num">12.4 kg</td>
                </tr>
                <tr><td>ORD-4213</td><td><span>General</span></td><td class="col-num">3.1 kg</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    <div class="popover" id="ai-cat-why" popover>
        <strong class="popover-title">Categorised by the intake agent</strong>
        <p>The packing list names glassware on 2 lines.</p>
        <div class="kv"><span class="k">Confidence</span><span class="confidence" data-level="3"><span class="confidence-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Sure</span></span></div>
        <div class="popover-actions">
            <button class="btn btn--sm" type="button" popovertarget="ai-cat-why" popovertargetaction="hide"><i class="ri-arrow-go-back-line"></i> <span>Revert to General</span></button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p>
        <span>Forecast for Friday: 1,240 orders</span>
        <button class="badge badge-ai" type="button" popovertarget="ai-forecast-why">
            <i class="ri-sparkling-2-line" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>AI</span>
            <span class="visually-hidden">— why this forecast</span>
        </button>
    </p>
    <div class="popover" id="ai-forecast-why" popover>
        <strong class="popover-title">Forecast by the planning agent</strong>
        <p>From the last 8 Fridays and the promotion starting on Thursday.</p>
        <div class="kv"><span class="k">Confidence</span><span class="confidence" data-level="1"><span class="confidence-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>A guess</span></span></div>
    </div>
</div>
